{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の土曜日に行われましたNARUTO THE  LIVE‼️‼️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46は、月の大きさという曲でNARUTO疾風伝のopをやらせて頂いた事があったので今回出れた事が嬉しくて嬉しくて。。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/04/14/0524615/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう生駒のテンションおかしかったですヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンポリのロケも行ったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンポリでもLIVEの様子が放送されると思うので皆さん楽しみにしてて下さいね〜⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラマとパシャリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/04/14/0524615/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モフモフしてましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番中も楽しかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC中にナルトくんに良かったよと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこま姫と言われた事は一生忘れません！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過呼吸になるくらいドキドキしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嗚呼、思い出したらまたニヤニヤ。(⁼̴̀ૢ꒳​⁼̴́ૢ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"竹内さんありがとうございますっ！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/04/14/0524615/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただの1ファンなのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって携われて嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p